93663072586,0.061077434569597244,0.010227201506495476,-0.02362959086894989,0.12196628004312515,0.047238584607839584,-0.04057084769010544,0.07868538051843643,-0.04302051290869713]],"metadata":[{"fileId":"miyb3tive2vtsf","filename":"PRIVACY POLICY.pdf","ownerUserId":"ZaidBinAsim","category":"WebDev Assets","department":"Data and Research Analyst","chunkIndex":0,"chunkText":"pg. 1 PRIVACY POLICY Last Updated: 8 TH DEC 2025 Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how ZakariaInk collects, uses, protects, and shares your information. 1. Information We Collect a. Personal Information We collect the following information when you place an order or contact us:  Full Name  Email  Phone  Address  City and Country  Postal Code  Payment Information  Device information such as IP address and browser type b. Usage Data We may collect data about how you use the website including:  Pages visited  Time spent on the website  Items viewed  Clicks and interactions c. Cookies We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. They help us remember your preferences and track website performance. 2. How We Use Your Information We use your information to: pg. 2  Process orders  Verify payments  Deliver products  Communicate updates regarding your order  Improve website performance  Provide customer support  Detect fraud or misuse  Show correct pricing based on your location  Keep records for legal and business purposes 3. Sharing Your Information We only share your information with trusted partners when necessary, such as:  Payment processors like Stripe or Elevate Pay  Local Pakistani banks (if you choose bank transfer)  Shipping and courier companies  Fraud prevention partners  Law enforcement if legally required We do not sell or rent your personal data to any third party. 4. Data Protection and Security We use security measures to protect your data including encryption, secure servers, and limited access controls. Although we take strong precautions, no system is completely secure. You use the website at your own risk. 5. Payment Information Payment details are handled by secure third party payment gateways. We do not store your credit card or banking information on our servers. pg. 3 6. International Data Transfers If you are located outside Pakistan, your data may be processed in Pakistan or other countries. By using our website, you agree to this transfer. 7. Your Rights Depending on your country, you may have the right to:  Access your data  Update or correct your data  Request deletion of your data  Withdraw consent  Request a copy of your data To request any of these actions, email us at azakaria599@gmail.com. 8. Retention of Data We keep your information for as long as necessary to complete your orders and meet legal requirements. 9. Children’s Privacy We do not knowingly collect information from individuals under the age of 13. If you believe a child has provided personal data, contact us immediately. 10. Updates to Privacy Policy We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The updated date will always be mentioned at the top.","totalChunks":1,"wordCount":467,"indexedAt":"2025-12-09T08:17:01.191Z"},{"fileId":"miyb54rbisfwgd","filename":"TERMS OF SERVICE.docx","ownerUserId":"ZaidBinAsim","category":"WebDev Assets","department":"Data and Research Analyst","chunkIndex":0,"chunkText":"TERMS OF SERVICE Last Updated: 8TH DEC 2025 Welcome to ZakariaInk. By accessing or using our website, services, or purchasing any artwork, you agree to follow these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully. If you do not agree, you may not use our website. 1. Acceptance of Terms By visiting our website or making a purchase, you confirm that you are at least 18 years old or have permission from a parent or legal guardian. 2. Use of the Website You agree to use this website only for lawful purposes. You will not attempt to harm, disable, disrupt, or misuse the website in any way. 3. Products and Artwork All artwork displayed on ZakariaInk is unique and owned by the artist.We try our best to display colors and details accurately, but slight variations may occur due to screen differences.Each product includes multiple images and descriptions to help you make a clear decision before purchase. 4. Pricing and Currency Prices are shown in PKR for customers in Pakistan and USD for customers outside Pakistan.Shipping costs and taxes are added during checkout based on your location. 5. Payments We offer multiple payment options and local bank transfers within Pakistan and Cash on Delivery inside Pakistan.You agree to provide correct and valid payment information. Fraudulent or unauthorized payments will result in cancellation of the order. 6. Order Confirmation and Cancellation After placing an order, you will receive an order confirmation email.We reserve the right to cancel an order if: Payment fails The product is unavailable Fraudulent activity is suspected If an order is canceled, a full refund will be provided if payment was received. 7. Shipping Shipping times vary based on location.International deliveries may take longer due to customs checks or local regulations.You are responsible for providing accurate shipping information. 8. Returns and Refunds All artwork sold on ZakariaInk is unique and handcrafted, so all sales are considered final. We do not accept returns or exchanges for reasons such as change of mind, personal preference, or color variations. We only accept returns if the artwork arrives damaged during transit. In such cases, the customer must contact us within 48 hours of delivery and provide clear photo or video proof of the damage. Once the evidence is reviewed and approved, we will guide you through the return process. Refunds are issued only after the returned artwork is received and inspected. Approved refunds will be processed to the original payment method within the standard processing time defined by your bank or payment provider. If the claim does not meet the above requirements, ZakariaInk reserves the right to decline the refund request. 9. Intellectual Property All content on ZakariaInk including artwork, images, text, logos, and designs belongs to ZakariaInk and the artist.You are not allowed to copy, reproduce, sell, or use any content without written permission. 10. Account Responsibilities If you create an account, you are responsible for keeping your login details secure.Any activity performed using your account is your responsibility. 11. Third Party Services","totalChunks":2,"wordCount":575,"indexedAt":"2025-12-09T08:17:57.054Z"},{"fileId":"miyb54rbisfwgd","filename":"TERMS OF SERVICE.docx","ownerUserId":"ZaidBinAsim","category":"WebDev Assets","department":"Data and Research Analyst","chunkIndex":1,"chunkText":"designs belongs to ZakariaInk and the artist.You are not allowed to copy, reproduce, sell, or use any content without written permission. 10. Account Responsibilities If you create an account, you are responsible for keeping your login details secure.Any activity performed using your account is your responsibility. 11. Third Party Services We use third party services. Your use of these services follows their respective policies. 12. Limitation of Liability ZakariaInk is not responsible for delays, losses, or damages caused by shipping partners, customs, or force majeure events.Our total liability will never exceed the total amount you paid for the order. 13. Changes to Terms We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of the website means you accept the updated terms.","totalChunks":2,"wordCount":575,"indexedAt":"2025-12-09T08:17:57.054Z"},{"fileId":"miyf2j089qyrvx","filename":"How to Open a Stripe Account in Pakistan.pptx","ownerUserId":"ZaidBinAsim","category":"WebDev Assets","department":"Data and Research Analyst","chunkIndex":0,"chunkText":"How to Open a Stripe Account in Pakistan Reference: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/open-stripe-account-pakistan-olusola-david-bd8cf/ February 5, 2025 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=acWIEzkJRFw 18-Jan-2025 Can You Use Stripe in Pakistan? Stripe is not directly available in Pakistan You can still receive payments online legally Need a business entity in a supported country (e.g., USA, Canada, Australia) Best and easiest option: Form a US LLC Requirements to Use Stripe Form a US LLC (via Northwest Registered Agent) Apply for EIN (tax ID) Obtain a US business address Get a US phone number Open a US bank account (Wise or Payoneer or US bank) Best US States for LLC as a Foreigner Wyoming Base filing fee: ~$100 Annual report fee: $60 + No state corporate tax for LLCs Strong privacy and simple setup New Mexico Base filing fee: ~$50 No annual report fee for domestic LLCs Private and straightforward setup Low overall cost Recommendation: New Mexico is best for beginners due to low fees, no annual report, and simple maintenance Steps to Form Your LLC Sign up with Northwest Registered Agent Select business type & state Provide business info (name, address) Enter management details Provide contact info Create account with Northwest Optional: Get Business Identity & EIN Pay and finalize formation Open Your Stripe Account Go to Stripe Register Enter email, LLC details, and select USA as country Verify email Provide: Business info Personal info Product/service type Bank details (Wise/Payoneer account) Enable two-step verification Why Northwest Registered Agent Base LLC formation from $39 + state fee First‑year registered‑agent service included (business address + mail handling) Business address keeps your personal address out of public records “Privacy by Default”: they do not sell your personal data Business‑identity extras (domain, website, email, phone) offered — domain free first year, other services free trial, paid afterward Transparent pricing and optional add‑ons Important to know After first year, registered‑agent service costs ~ $125/yr to maintain business address and compliance Additional services (mail forwarding, website hosting, phone, email) become paid after trial period How to Open a Stripe Account in Pakistan Reference: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/open-stripe-account-pakistan-olusola-david-bd8cf/ February 5, 2025 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=acWIEzkJRFw 18-Jan-2025","totalChunks":1,"wordCount":342,"indexedAt":"2025-12-09T10:07:55.439Z"}],"dimension":384,"version":"1.0","lastUpdated":"2025-12-09T10:07:55.439Z"}